WEBVTT

00:02:57.913 --> 00:03:00.174
I'm also in the process of out as trans.

00:03:00.198 --> 00:03:01.586
I'm changing my name to Micah

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:04.126
and my pronouns are he, him, his.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.938
If you have any questions
about my change in pronouns

00:03:06.962 --> 00:03:08.573
or my skin care needs,

00:03:08.597 --> 00:03:09.896
feel free to send an email

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:12.066
to my updated contact information.

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:14.537
And I'd also like to note
that while my skin is dry,

00:03:14.557 --> 00:03:16.276
it is not too sensitive.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.741
We're all going to mess up
my name and my pronouns,

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:19.939
myself included.

00:03:19.963 --> 00:03:22.662
So when this happens,
don't panic or cringe!

00:03:22.686 --> 00:03:24.016
Please be kind to yourself

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.423
as we stumble through
these growing pains together.

00:03:26.447 --> 00:03:29.088
I'm fortunate and grateful
to work in a place

00:03:29.112 --> 00:03:31.056
where I feel embraced in any form,